  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.7', 'Relational Databases and SQL', 'What happens if you omit WHERE in an UPDATE or DELETE?', 'Every record in the table is updated or deleted.', 24),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.7', 'Relational Databases and SQL', 'How do you combine conditions in SQL?', 'Using AND and OR, e.g. WHERE Age > 15 AND Year = 11.', 25),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.7', 'Relational Databases and SQL', 'How do you select data from two tables in SQL?', 'List both tables and link them with a condition on the foreign key, e.g. WHERE Orders.CustomerID = Customers.CustomerID.', 26),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.7', 'Relational Databases and SQL', 'What is a query?', 'A request to retrieve or change data in a database.', 27),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.7', 'Relational Databases and SQL', 'What is a data type in a database field?', 'The type of data stored, e.g. text, integer, real, date or Boolean.', 28),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.7', 'Relational Databases and SQL', 'Why is a text field used for phone numbers?', 'They can start with 0 and contain spaces or symbols, and aren''t used in calculations.', 29),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.7', 'Relational Databases and SQL', 'What is an entity?', 'A thing about which data is stored, e.g. a student, product or order.', 30),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is the Data Protection Act 2018?', 'UK law (implementing GDPR) controlling how personal data is collected, stored and used.', 1),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'Give three principles of data protection.', 'Data must be used fairly and lawfully, kept secure, accurate, up to date, and not kept longer than necessary.', 2),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is the Computer Misuse Act 1990?', 'UK law making unauthorised access to computer material and modification of data illegal.', 3),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What are the three offences in the Computer Misuse Act?', 'Unauthorised access; unauthorised access with intent to commit further crimes; unauthorised modification of data.', 4),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is the Copyright, Designs and Patents Act 1988?', 'UK law protecting intellectual property, such as software, music and images, from being copied without permission.', 5),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is software licensing?', 'Legal permission to use software, which sets out how it can be used.', 6),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is open-source software?', 'Software whose source code is freely available to view, modify and distribute.', 7),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is proprietary software?', 'Software whose source code is kept secret, usually sold with a licence restricting use.', 8),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'Give an advantage of open-source software.', 'It is usually free and can be modified to suit users'' needs.', 9),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'Give an advantage of proprietary software.', 'It usually comes with professional support and regular updates.', 10),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is an ethical issue?', 'An issue about what is morally right or wrong.', 11),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is a legal issue?', 'An issue about what is permitted or forbidden by law.', 12),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is a cultural issue?', 'An issue about how technology affects society, traditions and ways of life.', 13),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is an environmental issue?', 'An issue about the impact of technology on the environment.', 14),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is the digital divide?', 'The gap between people who have access to technology and the internet and those who don''t.', 15),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What causes the digital divide?', 'Cost, location (rural areas), age, disability and lack of skills.', 16),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is e-waste?', 'Discarded electronic devices, which contain toxic materials and are often not recycled properly.', 17),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'How does computing affect the environment?', 'Energy use, mining for raw materials, and e-waste; but it can also reduce travel and paper use.', 18),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What are privacy concerns with technology?', 'Personal data collection, tracking, surveillance and data breaches.', 19),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What are the ethical issues of artificial intelligence?', 'Bias, job losses, accountability for decisions, and privacy.', 20),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'How has technology affected employment?', 'It has created new jobs (e.g. in IT) but replaced some jobs through automation.', 21),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is cyberbullying?', 'Using technology to harass, threaten or embarrass someone.', 22),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What are the health issues of computer use?', 'Eye strain, repetitive strain injury, back problems and reduced physical activity.', 23),
  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.8', 'Ethical, Legal and Environmental Impacts', 'What is a stakeholder?', 'A person or group affected by a technology or decision.', 24),
